commit 4109d7b0ef54ee655831261a50cfd841b859fcd9
Author: Chris Vest <christianvest_hansen@apple.com>
Date:   Fri Jul 18 08:33:14 2025 -0700

    Fix NPE and AssertionErrors when many tasks are scheduled and cancell… (#15501)

    …ed (#15499)

    Motivation:
    The ScheduledFutureTask uses unique IDs to disambiguate tasks in the
    priority queue, but these IDs were not always set, leading the queue to
    break invariants and get into an invalid state.

    Modification:
    Ensure that scheduled tasks always have a valid ID before adding them to
    the scheduling priority queue.

    Result:
    No more NullPointerExceptions and AssertionErrors from our priority
    queue.

    Fixes https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/15492

